{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65fd006234c4ab293008cc1b2311ff4bfdea5aeca6307a8358c4e1b277fd54de",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_b:2_4_006_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59d152d891361690e965afc7e134989318d75a23a2146daac0046e844548e1bd",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。\n我刚出门。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_b:2_4_006_02_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a325ff67e471c462294a162230983f581d7f56ee605d5981f4c565ebef08c21",
      "text": "今天天气非常晴朗呢。\n明明日历上已经是秋天了，却还是这么热……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_b:2_4_006_02_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af77e3adce9f0d746717813f8bfb129160fd9d1c540e7d0d4eca7c66a648d1ab",
      "text": "刚好借这个机会，我试着戴上了买了之后\n就一直放着的棒球帽。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_b:2_4_006_02_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2b180da1d991121125753a0596e4a16525df965ab02c987bdf9e694f1a9efc0",
      "text": "接下这次的工作之后，我就想尝试看看\n和平时不一样的搭配了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_b:2_4_006_02_09_b:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd28edcec080a38fcfbb93a21979ab9806f4d565106865202f00a70a0113f51b",
      "text": "很想看看呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_b:2_4_006_02_09_b:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2195d347aa50acaa2bc60a557ea5c0449d8f5fc85ce2d66220a0612b8bd2ac12",
      "text": "是受了时装秀的\n影响吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_b:2_4_006_02_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2badd041a28d34bc78d88c6c086239fd86c3e344e21cf823cf0bdc1ee1dbba7d",
      "text": "呵呵。到了之后请跟我说说感想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_b:2_4_006_02_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6b52df6afbc70f07e4512b68f299b3a743ac90db0a13c3a7a165a3e7451ef5e",
      "text": "是的。\n偶尔尝试不一样的时尚也很开心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_b:2_4_006_02_09_b:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:176dc71dee68b3f7f82389ebc87d99dab565b7bbd3782934c03bd6ccee6d46ca",
      "text": "为了能在时装秀上穿出衣服的韵味，\n今天也得好好努力练台步才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_b:2_4_006_02_09_b:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d1e859e65ac8b31c031922833a01e9268bc2d58a2d1f9719a444956ce151333",
      "text": "那就待会儿见！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
